Package: acutils
Type: Package
Title: Helpers for the Mithril Metrics Case Studies
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Pietro", "Sala", email = "pietro.sala@tum.de",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0002-0668-8275"))
Description: Cached, dated fetchers for public agricultural and economic data
    (FAOSTAT bulk files, Eurostat, World Bank WDI, USDA ERS International
    Agricultural Productivity, World Bank Pink Sheet, Copernicus ERA5 monthly),
    a panel diagnostics helper, a ggplot2 theme and figure exporter, and a
    key-numbers store so that text, figures and posts never disagree.
